TeamTalkHU — License Information
================================

TeamTalkHU is a modified build of the TeamTalk 5 Android client.

The Android client source code, the TeamTalk 5 SDK (including
TeamTalk5.jar) and the native TeamTalk5 libraries are owned by
BearWare.dk and are distributed under the proprietary "TeamTalk 5 SDK
License Agreement". Use of the SDK requires a TeamTalk SDK License Key
issued by BearWare.dk, and the SDK itself may not be redistributed or
modified except as permitted by that agreement.

Full license text:
https://github.com/BearWare/TeamTalk5/blob/master/LICENSE.txt

Modifications to the client (package rename, Hungarian translation,
feature changes, branding) were made by Horvath Romeo.

This project is a fork and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
BearWare.dk.
